  data: {
    LLM: "Concentrate on the players to your immediate left and right first, as those are the piles you will see most clearly.\n\nMemorize the animal associated with each player before the first card is even dealt. Repeat them in your head: 'John=Pig, Sarah=Cow...'\n\nThe 'Wait and Bait': If you see a match, wait a fraction of a second to ensure the opponent doesn't notice first, then bark clearly to claim the pile before they can react.",
    Player: "Concentrate on the players to your immediate left and right first, as those are the piles you will see most clearly.\n\nMemorize the animal associated with each player before the first card is even dealt. Repeat them in your head: 'John=Pig, Sarah=Cow...'\n\nThe 'Wait and Bait': If you see a match, wait a fraction of a second to ensure the opponent doesn't notice first, then bark clearly to claim the pile before they can react.",
